﻿# Dataset licences

This package **redistributes no third-party data**.  `data/` contains only the two
mapping tables we wrote (`col_mappings.csv`, `alias_mapping.yaml`); every dataset is
fetched from its official record by `fetch_datasets.bat`, which also performs the
preparation steps listed in section 3.

The licences below therefore govern the copies on your machine.

